      ":question/problem": "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\\frac{dy}{dt}= \\\\ \\frac{y^{2} - 5 y + 6}{y - 1}\\end{gathered}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following are equilibrium solutions? Select all that apply.",
